5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I worry about who does the extra work. We need to check staffing levels.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about external dependencies. We must verify network coverage at customer plants.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I need to know where the money comes from. I will look into capital budget and software allowance.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,We keep repeating mistakes. I want to see the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I see small daily losses. I will check time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, does network coverage affect how much manual work we have to do?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Yes, if the link is weak, we cannot rely on automated sync.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@May, do the past rollouts show if we overspent on maintenance?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I hope so. I suspect we ignored the long-term cost of support.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. We need to see if the effort matches the actual gain.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I am still unsure. I will look into in-house developer availability to see if we have people.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,That is wise. I will also check in-house developer availability to confirm capacity.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will also check vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work to understand the bill.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will also check record of cross-unit standardization efforts to see if we are consistent.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will also check misrouted deliveries in the incident logs to see the real errors.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we find a way that does not burn out the team.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I hope we find a way that does not break on day one.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I hope we find a way that does not bankrupt us next year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I hope we find a way that actually sticks around.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we find a way that saves us time every single day.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
